      "statement": "docker-compose.yml defines the always-on app services postgres (postgres:16-alpine pinned by digest), web (port 3001), server (port 3000), redis, and manticore (6.3.8), plus opt-in profile-gated services: projector (profile projector), poller (profile poller), raw-storage-minio/raw-storage-minio-init (profile storage), and manticore29 (profile shadow). The profile services never start under a plain `docker compose up`.",
