    {
      "id": "claim_c1d6fd25a1384ff5a12c3d95e7784626",
      "statement": "/readyz (RJC-391) checks five components independently, each on its own timeout (READINESS_CHECK_TIMEOUT_MS=1500ms), and caches the composite result for READINESS_CACHE_MS=2000ms so a probe storm cannot DoS Manticore or S3. The components are postgres, manticore, rawObjectStore, redis, and searchProjection; the worst status decides the overall verdict: any of postgres/manticore/rawObjectStore(filesystem-in-prod)/searchProjection(schema mismatch) failed => unavailable (HTTP 503); otherwise any degraded => degraded (HTTP 200); otherwise ready (HTTP 200). Raw errors are never serialized; every reason is a fixed pre-defined string.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/readiness.ts#L17-L97",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:d3995cc397bf92b2cc924593085581d678d927bbb90b6b3e8bd9cb653d3080dd:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/readiness.ts#L439-L543",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:bfa748066b6918f6eb872638a4c7d0c448fefcfa7d0360a60a48b818493aa20a:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7231758457bd4c52ae708e09126f6a3c",
      "statement": "In /readyz, postgres failed means migration mismatch or unreachable (unavailable); manticore failed means unreachable or SHOW TABLES missing both partition tables aanvragen_active and aanvragen_archive (unavailable, RJC-383); rawObjectStore filesystem-in-production is a hard failure (unavailable) while S3 sentinel probe failure is degraded; redis unset is not-configured (no overall effect) while a configured-but-failed ping is degraded; searchProjection schemaHash mismatch is unavailable (stale generation), outbox lag > 300s is degraded (lag_elevated), > 3600s is still degraded (lag_critical), and a failed checkpoint/lag read is degraded (projection_read_failed).",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://apps/server/src/readiness.ts#L185-L404",
